msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>You can align images, videos, blockquotes and so on to "
"the left, right or center. Examples:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li>Align an image to the left: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image "
"to the center: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image to the right: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"       "
"   <li>… and you can apply this to other elements as well: "
"<code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"    </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Þú getur fært myndir, myndbönd, innskot (blockquotes) og annað "
"slíkt til vinstri, hægri eða miðju. Dæmi:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"   "
"       <li>Færa mynd til vinstri: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Færa mynd í "
"miðju: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Færa mynd til hægri: <code>&lt;img "
"src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>… og "
"þú getur notað þetta líka á aðra þætti: <code>&lt;video "
"src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"        </ul>"

msgid "Align images"
msgstr "Jafna myndir"

msgid ""
"Uses a <code>data-align</code> attribute on <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> "
"tags to align images."
msgstr ""
"Notar <code>data-align</code>-eiginleika á "
"<code>&lt;img&gt;</code>-merkingar til að samræma myndir."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>You can caption images, videos, blockquotes, and so on. "
"Examples:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"This is a caption\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"The Drupal Dance\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;blockquote "
"data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal is "
"awesome!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world in "
"JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  "
"      </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Þú getur sett undirskrift á myndir, myndbönd, tilvitnanir og "
"svo framvegis. Dæmi:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-caption=\"Þetta er undirskrift\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" "
"data-caption=\"Drupölans dans\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;blockquote data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal er "
"frábært!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Halló heimur á "
"JavaScript.\"&gt;alert(\"Halló "
"heimur!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"        </ul>"

msgid "Caption images"
msgstr "Fyrirsagnir myndir"

msgid ""
"Uses a <code>data-caption</code> attribute on <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> "
"tags to caption images."
msgstr ""
"Notar <code>data-caption</code>-eiginleika á "
"<code>&lt;img&gt;</code>-tögum til að setja myndatexta á myndir."

